<heading>accounts add - Create an account.</heading>

<rule/>

<heading level="2">
Usage
</heading>

<pre>
  add NAME
  add NAME --password SECRET
  add NAME --password SECRET --name "Stefan Bergmann" --mail s@b.de --language de
</pre>

<heading level="2">
Description
</heading>

<paragraph>
Creates a new account with the given login name. Use --password to set
credentials. Profile options (--name, --mail, --language) are optional —
a human account carries them, a bot account does not.
</paragraph>

<heading level="2">
Examples
</heading>

<pre>
add alice
  Create account alice without a password.
add backup --password secret
  Create a bot account without a profile.
add stefan --name "Stefan Bergmann" --mail s@b.de
  Create a human account with profile information.
</pre>

<heading level="2">
See also
</heading>

<paragraph>
list, edit, delete, groups, grants
</paragraph>
